**TASK 3 (10 marks)**

The C and Pascal programs below perform the same task. Select any one of them and answer the questions that follow.

**C Program**

```c
#include <stdio.h>
int main(void) {
  int num;
  printf("Enter a number: ");
  scanf("%d",&num);
  while (num > 5) {
      printf("%d  ",num);
      num = num-1;
  }
  getchar();
}
```

**Pascal Program**

```pascal
program Numbers;
var num: integer;
BEGIN
    write('Enter a number: ');
    readln(num);
    while num > 5 do
       begin
            write(num,'  ');
            num := num - 1;
       end;
    readln;
END.
```
